<div class="container"><header class="page-heading"><h1>{{ page.title | escape }}</h1></header><div class="page-prose rte"><p>All measurements are garment measurements in inches, taken with the tee laid flat (1&Prime; = 2.54&nbsp;cm). Actual measurements may vary by up to 1&Prime;.</p><h2>Regular — Unisex round neck</h2><table class="size-chart"><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Chest</th><th>Length</th><th>Sleeve</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>S</td><td>38</td><td>26</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>M</td><td>40</td><td>27</td><td>7.5</td></tr><tr><td>L</td><td>42</td><td>28</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>XL</td><td>44</td><td>29</td><td>8.5</td></tr><tr><td>XXL</td><td>46</td><td>30</td><td>9</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Regular fit — a familiar, easy silhouette. Take your usual size.</p><h2>Oversized — Premium oversized tee</h2><table class="size-chart"><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Chest</th><th>Length</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>S</td><td>42</td><td>28</td></tr><tr><td>M</td><td>44</td><td>29</td></tr><tr><td>L</td><td>46</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>XL</td><td>48</td><td>31</td></tr><tr><td>XXL</td><td>50</td><td>32</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Oversized fit — a broader, relaxed silhouette with dropped shoulders. Take your usual size for a relaxed look, or size down for a closer fit.</p><h2>Kids — family combos</h2><table class="size-chart"><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Age</th><th>Chest</th><th>Length</th><th>Sleeve</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>8</td><td>7 – 8Y</td><td>30</td><td>20</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>9 – 10Y</td><td>32</td><td>21.5</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>11 – 12Y</td><td>34</td><td>23</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>13 – 14Y</td><td>36</td><td>24.5</td><td>7.5</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Kids tee — regular fit, sized by age. Pick the size matching your kid&rsquo;s age; size up if between ages.</p><h2>How to measure</h2><ul><li>Lay a T-shirt that fits you well flat, without stretching it.</li><li><strong>Chest:</strong> measure across the garment, just below the armholes.</li><li><strong>Length:</strong> measure from the highest shoulder point beside the neck to the hem.</li><li>Compare with the chart for the silhouette you are buying — the same size label measures differently on Regular and Oversized.</li></ul></div></div>
